  "helmetHead": "<title>Dharmshala Booking &amp; Management Software — WhatsApp Based | Chakrio</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Manage your dharmshala's bookings, rooms, and expenses entirely by WhatsApp. Bulk group bookings, festival campaigns, monthly P&amp;L. Trusted at Raghuleela Dham, Goverdhan.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://chakrio.com/dharmshala\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Dharmshala Booking &amp; Management Software — WhatsApp Based | Chakrio\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Manage your dharmshala's bookings, rooms, and expenses entirely by WhatsApp. Bulk group bookings, festival campaigns, monthly P&amp;L.\">\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://chakrio.com/dharmshala\">\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Dharmshala Booking &amp; Management Software | Chakrio\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Manage your dharmshala's bookings, rooms, and expenses entirely by WhatsApp.\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n    {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"WebSite\",\n      \"name\": \"Chakrio\",\n      \"url\": \"https://chakrio.com\",\n      \"description\": \"AI-powered property booking automation for boutique hotels, villas, homestays, and guesthouses.\",\n      \"publisher\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n        \"name\": \"Chakrio\",\n        \"url\": \"https://chakrio.com\"\n      }\n    }\n    </script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n    {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"SoftwareApplication\",\n      \"name\": \"Chakrio\",\n      \"url\": \"https://chakrio.com\",\n      \"applicationCategory\": \"BusinessApplication\",\n      \"operatingSystem\": \"Web\",\n      \"description\": \"AI-powered property booking automation for boutique hotels, villas, homestays, and guesthouses worldwide. Property managers record bookings, cancellations, and expenses by sending a plain-language message via WhatsApp or Telegram. The dashboard updates automatically.\",\n      \"offers\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n        \"price\": \"0\",\n        \"description\": \"14-day free trial\"\n      },\n      \"publisher\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n        \"name\": \"Chakrio\",\n        \"url\": \"https://chakrio.com\",\n        \"description\": \"Chakrio is a property management SaaS for independent hospitality operators — boutique hotels, villas, homestays, guesthouses, and B&Bs.\",\n        \"contactPoint\": {\n          \"@type\": \"ContactPoint\",\n          \"contactType\": \"customer support\",\n          \"availableLanguage\": [\"English\"]\n        }\n      },\n      \"audience\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Audience\",\n        \"audienceType\": \"Property managers, boutique hotel owners, villa operators, homestay and guesthouse managers\"\n      },\n      \"datePublished\": \"2026-01-01\",\n      \"dateModified\": \"2026-06-22\",\n      \"featureList\": [\n        \"Record bookings by sending a plain-language chat message\",\n        \"AI parses guest name, dates, and amounts automatically\",\n        \"Cancellation and refund tracking\",\n        \"Expense logging via message\",\n        \"Guest experience automation (confirmations, reminders, review requests)\",\n        \"OTA iCal calendar sync\",\n        \"WhatsApp broadcast campaigns to past guests\",\n        \"Real-time dashboard with revenue and expense reports\",\n        \"Multi-property support\",\n        \"Occupancy rate calculator\",\n        \"Rental income calculator\",\n        \"Cancellation policy generator\"\n      ]\n    }\n    </script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"name\":\"Dharmshala Booking & Management Software — WhatsApp Based | Chakrio\",\"url\":\"https://chakrio.com/dharmshala\",\"description\":\"Manage your dharmshala's bookings, rooms, and expenses entirely by WhatsApp.\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Chakrio\",\"url\":\"https://chakrio.com\"}}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is Chakrio designed for dharmshalas specifically?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Our first client is Raghuleela Dham in Goverdhan — a 60-room dharmshala that used to manage everything in a physical register. Chakrio handles high-volume group bookings, festival rushes, and bulk arrivals in plain Hindi or English messages.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can we log group bookings for 10–20 pilgrims at once?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. You can send a single message like \\\"Sharma group, 15 people, 3 nights from Purnima\\\" and Chakrio logs it as one booking. Each booking holds arrival dates, group size, room, advance, and balance.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does it work in Hindi?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The AI understands natural language — if your team types in Hindi or a mix of Hindi and English, Chakrio parses it correctly. No need to switch to English or fill in fields.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I track prasad and maintenance expenses?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Type any expense in WhatsApp — prasad, maintenance, repairs — and Chakrio records it instantly. Your monthly P&L report breaks it down by category.\"}}]}</script>",
  "bodyHtml": "\n    <div id=\"root\"><div class=\"min-h-screen text-text-1 flex flex-col\" style=\"background: rgb(14, 11, 20);\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"name\":\"Dharmshala Booking & Management Software — WhatsApp Based | Chakrio\",\"url\":\"https://chakrio.com/dharmshala\",\"description\":\"Manage your dharmshala's bookings, rooms, and expenses entirely by WhatsApp.\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Chakrio\",\"url\":\"https://chakrio.com\"}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is Chakrio designed for dharmshalas specifically?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Our first client is Raghuleela Dham in Goverdhan — a 60-room dharmshala that used to manage everything in a physical register. Chakrio handles high-volume group bookings, festival rushes, and bulk arrivals in plain Hindi or English messages.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can we log group bookings for 10–20 pilgrims at once?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. You can send a single message like \\\"Sharma group, 15 people, 3 nights from Purnima\\\" and Chakrio logs it as one booking. Each booking holds arrival dates, group size, room, advance, and balance.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does it work in Hindi?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The AI understands natural language — if your team types in Hindi or a mix of Hindi and English, Chakrio parses it correctly. No need to switch to English or fill in fields.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I track prasad and maintenance expenses?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Type any expense in WhatsApp — prasad, maintenance, repairs — and Chakrio records it instantly. Your monthly P&L report breaks it down by category.\"}}]}</script><nav 