ngs in Hindi or English — log everything by WhatsApp message. No register, no spreadsheet.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3\"><a href=\"https://wa.me/919461888529?text=Hi%2C+I+want+to+see+Chakrio+for+my+dharmshala\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"background: rgb(201, 162, 75); color: rgb(14, 11, 20); border: none; border-radius: 11px; padding: 15px 28px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none; font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, sans-serif; box-shadow: rgb(201, 162, 75) 0px 14px 34px -14px;\">Chat with us on WhatsApp</a><a href=\"/onboard\" data-discover=\"true\" style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); color: rgb(244, 241, 234); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14); border-radius: 11px; padding: 15px 28px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none; font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, sans-serif;\">Start Free Trial →</a></div></header><section class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 pb-16 w-full\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border p-8\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(at 50% 0%, rgba(201, 162, 75, 0.1) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02) 70%); border-color: rgb(201, 162, 75) rgba(201, 162, 75, 0.35) rgba(201, 162, 75, 0.35); border-top-width: 2px; border-top-style: solid;\"><blockquote class=\"text-sm text-text-2 leading-relaxed mb-6\">\"Chakrio completely changed how we manage our bookings. What used to take an hour of writing in our register now happens automatically the moment we send a message. We can track expenses through the reports and check room availability quite easily.\"</blockquote><div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 mb-6\"><div class=\"rounded-xl p-3 text-center\" style=\"background: rgba(201, 162, 75, 0.07); border: 1px solid rgba(201, 162, 75, 0.15);\"><p class=\"font-display font-extrabold text-sm text-text-1 mb-0.5\">60 rooms</p><p class=\"text-text-3 text-xs leading-tight\">Property size</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl p-3 text-center\" style=\"background: rgba(201, 162, 75, 0.07); border: 1px solid rgba(201, 162, 75, 0.15);\"><p class=\"font-display font-extrabold text-sm text-text-1 mb-0.5\">Physical register</p><p class=\"text-text-3 text-xs leading-tight\">Was using before</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl p-3 text-center\" style=\"background: rgba(201, 162, 75, 0.07); border: 1px solid rgba(201, 162, 75, 0.15);\"><p class=\"font-display font-extrabold text-sm text-text-1 mb-0.5\">1 hr/day</p><p class=\"text-text-3 text-xs leading-tight\">Saved on record-keeping</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-display font-extrabold text-sm flex-shrink-0\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgb(201, 162, 75), rgb(184, 147, 74)); color: rgb(14, 11, 20);\">KS</div><div><p class=\"font-display font-extrabold text-base text-text-1\">Koustubh Sharma</p><p class=\"text-sm font-medium\" style=\"color: rgb(201, 162, 75);\">Owner, Raghuleela Dham</p><p class=\"text-text-3 text-xs mt-0.5\">Goverdhan, Uttar Pradesh</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 pb-20 w-full\"><h2 class=\"font-display font-extrabold text-2xl text-text-1 mb-8 tracking-tight text-center\">Built for how dharmshalas actually work</h2><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border p-6\" style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.024); border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);\"><h3 class=\"font-display font-extrabold text-text-1 text-base mb-2\">Group &amp; bulk bookings</h3><p class=\"text-text-2 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Log a group of 20 pilgrims in one message — name, room type, dates, advance. No separate entries per person.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border p-6\" style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.024); border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);\"><h3 class=\"font-display font-extrabold text-text-1 text-base mb-2\">Hindi-friendly natural language</h3><p class=\"text-text-2 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Type as you speak — Hindi, English, or mixed. The AI understands context and extracts booking details correctly.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border p-6\" style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.024); border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);\"><h3 class=\"font-display font-extrabold text-text-1 text-base mb-2\">Festival-season campaigns</h3><p class=\"text-text-2 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Send a WhatsApp broadcast to previous guests ahead of Holi, Diwali, or Janmashtami. Personalised, tracked, and ₹1.25 per delivered message.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border p-6\" style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.024); border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);\"><h3 class=\"font-display font-extrabold text-text-1 text-base mb-2\">Monthly P&amp;L reports</h3><p class=\"text-text-2 text-sm leading-relaxed\">On the 1st of each month, get a full P&amp;L on WhatsApp — total revenue, expenses by category, and net surplus. Auto-sent.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border p-6\" style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.024); border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);\"><h3 class=\"font-display font-extrabold text-text-1 text-base mb-2\">Google review funnel</h3><p class=\"text-text-2 text-sm leading-relaxed\">After checkout, Chakrio sends a polite message asking guests to leave a review. No manual follow-up required.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border p-6\" style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.024); border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);\"><h3 class=\"font-display font-extrabold text-text-1 text-base mb-2\">Expense tracking for all costs</h3><p class=\"text-text-2 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Log maintenance costs, prasad expenses, and repair bills in one WhatsApp message. Categorised automatically in your monthly P&amp;L.</p></div></div></section><section id=\"pricing\" class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 pb-20 w-full\"><p class=\"text-xs font-mono font-medium uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 text-center\" style=\"color: rgb(201, 162, 75);\">Pricing</p><h2 class=\"font-display font-extrabold text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-text-1 mb-3 tracking-tight text-center\">Dharmshala pricing</h2><p class=\"text-text-2 text-center max-w-xl mx-auto mb-6\">Priced by room count. Dorms can be billed as rooms or per bed. 14-day free trial, every plan includes everything above.</p><div class=\"text-center mb-10\"><div role=\"radiogroup\" aria-label=\"Billing period\" class=\"inline-flex p-1 gap-1\" style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); border-radius: 12px;\"><label class=\"cursor-pointer select-none focus-within:ring-2 focus-within:ring-[#C9A24B]\" style=\"padding: 8px 18px; border-radius: 9px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, sans-serif; background: rgb(201, 162, 75); color: rgb(14, 11, 20); transition: background 0.15s, color 0.15s;\"><input class=\"sr-only\" type=\"radio\" checked=\"\" name=\"_r_0_\">Monthly</label><label class=\"cursor-pointer select-none focus-within:ring-2 focus-within:ring-[#C9A24B]\" style=\"padding: 8px 18px; border-radius: 9px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, sans-serif; background: transparent; color: rgb(207, 202, 217); transition: background 0.15s, color 0.15s;\"><input class=\"sr-only\" type=\"radio\" name=\"_r_0_\">Yearly<span style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; margin-left: 6px; color: rgb(201, 162, 75);\">2 months free</span></label></div></div><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-4 items-stretch\"><div style=\"border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.024); border-radius: 18px; padding: 24px; position: relative; box-shadow: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column;\"><div style=\"font-weight: 600; color: rgb(207, 202, 217); font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">Ashray</div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 2px;\"><span class=\"font-display font-extrabo