255, 255, 255, 0.09); border-radius: 16px;\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-5 cursor-pointer list-none select-none\"><span class=\"font-medium text-text-1 pr-4\">Can we log group bookings for 10–20 pilgrims at once?</span><span class=\"text-text-3 text-lg flex-shrink-0\">+</span></summary><p class=\"px-6 pb-5 text-text-2 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Yes. You can send a single message like \"Sharma group, 15 people, 3 nights from Purnima\" and Chakrio logs it as one booking. Each booking holds arrival dates, group size, room, advance, and balance.</p></details><details style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.024); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09); border-radius: 16px;\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-5 cursor-pointer list-none select-none\"><span class=\"font-medium text-text-1 pr-4\">Does it work in Hindi?</span><span class=\"text-text-3 text-lg flex-shrink-0\">+</span></summary><p class=\"px-6 pb-5 text-text-2 text-sm leading-relaxed\">The AI understands natural language — if your team types in Hindi or a mix of Hindi and English, Chakrio parses it correctly. No need to switch to English or fill in fields.</p></details><details style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.024); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09); border-radius: 16px;\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-5 cursor-pointer list-none select-none\"><span class=\"font-medium text-text-1 pr-4\">Can I track prasad and maintenance expenses?</span><span class=\"text-text-3 text-lg flex-shrink-0\">+</span></summary><p class=\"px-6 pb-5 text-text-2 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Yes. Type any expense in WhatsApp — prasad, maintenance, repairs — and Chakrio records it instantly. Your monthly P&amp;L report breaks it down by category.</p></details></div></section><div class=\"text-center pb-10\"><a href=\"/\" data-discover=\"true\" style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(201, 162, 75); text-decoration: underline;\">← Back to C